\begin_layout Standard
Or, if 
\begin_inset Formula $\sigma_{k-j}(A)\gg\sigma_{k+l}(A)$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $\forall j,l\geq1$
\end_inset

, can we prove the singular space is seperated?
