, 
\begin_inset Formula $\Lambda_{1}$
\end_inset

 outside 
\begin_inset Formula $\left[\alpha-\delta,\beta+\delta\right]$
\end_inset

).
 Then for any unitarily invariant norm 
\begin_inset Formula $\left\Vert \cdot\right\Vert _{U}$
